==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

